BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (Execution starts at the desk and finishes on the road. Bama Billboards begins by pulling 10 to 15 candidate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (parcels from the county GIS and recording the PPIN and owner details for each. Every parcel is then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (checked against spacing rules of 600 to 1,500 feet from other boards and 600 to 1,000 feet from commercial) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (activity, and only then do landowner letters go out [rxbKA112Tdc @ 00:01:30]. Mr. Money prices the state) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (permit at $500 to $2,000, with a 60-to-120-day wait between application and approval [t4mEx2qxaZ8 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (00:04:27]. Justin Booher of Vital Outdoor shows what reading the code line by line can produce. Booher's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (fifth site came from a rare CBD zoning class, the last one listed in the sign regulations, and the ODOT permit) Tj ET
