BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (Each step either kills the site cheaply or feeds the next one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (Operators use the lease to protect cash before the first ad runs. Robert Wallace's template runs 360 months) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (and starts rent only after the permits are obtained, the structure is installed and ads are posted. Wallace) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (reports this trigger has worked many times and warns against paying monthly land rent from the day the) Tj ET
