BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (permits fail [t4mEx2qxaZ8 @ 00:04:49]. Wallace calls assignability the most important sentence in the lease.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (It lets an operator with no capital sign leases and sell them, ideally without the landlord's written consent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm ([hxwD9JLVZs8 @ 00:19:46]. The rest of the Wallace template builds on those terms. It gives the tenant sole) Tj ET
